est side of the road. Just north of this is a small parking lot (on east side of road). There are side roads within a half mile to the north and south if you need to turn around\n<p>\n<b>4.6 mi</b> to next destination (<b>9 mins</b>).\nYou should be leaving by <b>10:23</b>.\n<h3>Dropping off</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>A14</b> (10 people)\n</ul>\n<li>Head <b>southeast</b> on <b>Trescott Rd</b> toward <b>Appalachian National Scenic Trail</b>/<wbr/><b>Appalachian Trl</b> &mdash; 0.9 mi\n<li>Turn <b>left</b> onto <b>Etna Rd</b> &mdash; 0.7 mi\n<li>Turn <b>right</b> onto <b>Ruddsboro Rd</b> &mdash; 1.5 mi\n<li>Turn <b>left</b> onto <b>3 Mile Rd</b><div style="font-size:0.9em">Destination will be on the right</div> &mdash; 1.5 mi\n,<li>\n<h2>Harris Cabin (43.720566,-72.173885)</h2>\n<p>Drop at "no camping" sign in the valley betwen two knolls. Large pull off to the side of the road.\n<p>\n<b>8.5 mi</b> to next destination (<b>18 mins</b>).\nYou should be leaving by <b>10:47</b>.\n<h3>Dropping off</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>A422.3</b> (10 people)\n<li><b>A831</b> (10 people)\n</ul>\n<li>Head <b>northeast</b> on <b>3 Mile Rd</b> toward <b>Wolfeboro Rd</b> &mdash; 1.4 mi\n<li>Turn <b>left</b> onto <b>Ferson Rd</b> &mdash; 1.0 mi\n<li>Turn <b>right</b> onto <b>Hanover Center Rd</b> &mdash; 1.3 mi\n<li>Continue onto <b>Baker Hill Rd</b> &mdash; 1.3 mi\n<li>Turn <b>left</b> to stay on <b>Baker Hill Rd</b> &mdash; 2.2 mi\n<li>Turn <b>right</b> onto <b>Dorchester Rd</b> &mdash; 1.2 mi\n<li>Keep <b>right</b> to continue on <b>Grafton Turnpike Rd</b> &mdash; 0.1 mi\n,<li>\n<h2>Holt''s Ledge Trailhead (43.791553, -72.101885)</h2>\n<p>Grass/gravel pull-out on left, before reaching the Skiway\n<p>\n<b>0.3 mi</b> to next destination (<b>1 min</b>).\nYou should be leaving by <b>11:21</b>.\n<h3>Dropping off</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>A423.5</b> (10 people)\n</ul>\n<li>Head <b>southeast</b> on <b>Grafton Turnpike Rd</b> &mdash; 0.3 mi\n,<li>\n<h2>Dartmouth Skiway -- Dartmouth Skiway,  39 Grafton Turnpike (43.787