 <b>left</b> onto <b>NH-118 N</b>/<wbr/><b>NH-25 W</b> &mdash; 0.6 mi\n<li>Turn <b>right</b> onto <b>NH-118 N</b> &mdash; 5.9 mi\n<li>Turn <b>left</b> onto <b>Ravine Rd</b><div style="font-size:0.9em">Destination will be on the left</div> &mdash; 1.5 mi\n,<li>\n<h2>Moosilauke Ravine Lodge (43.993096, -71.815442)</h2>\n<p>Bear right at the fork at the end of the road. Do NOT bear left and go down the hill. Turn around when the road ends, then let trippees off by the walkway on the right\n<p>\n<b>10.0 mi</b> to next destination (<b>18 mins</b>).\nYou should be leaving by <b>10:52</b>.\n<h3>Dropping off</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>B34.8</b> (10 people)\n</ul>\n<li>Head <b>southwest</b> on <b>Ravine Rd</b> toward <b>Service Rd</b> &mdash; 1.5 mi\n<li>Turn <b>left</b> onto <b>NH-118 N</b> &mdash; 7.1 mi\n<li>Slight <b>right</b> onto <b>NH-112 E</b> &mdash; 1.3 mi\n<li>Turn <b>right</b> onto <b>Crooked Pike Rd</b><div style="font-size:0.9em">Restricted usage road</div><div style="font-size:0.9em">Destination will be on the right</div> &mdash; 75 ft\n,<li>\n<h2>Ritchie Smith Cabin (44.029205,-71.710167)</h2>\n<p>On Rt. 112 and drive past a group of white buildings on the left and a single one on the right. Drop the group off at the wooden bridge on your right. Just a bit farther on the left is Lost Valley road, where you can turn around if needed\n<h3>Dropping off</h3>\n<ul>\n<li><b>B531</b> (12 people)\n</ul>\n\n</ol>\n','\n',char(10)),1754665410);
